  RemoveNetUISystrayIcon
  IsPropSheetDialogMessage
  ClosePropSheetDialogIfReady
  UpdateConnectionStatus
  ShowCertificate
  ShowCertificateEx
  CreateScanDevice
  RasEapInvokeConfigUI
  RasEapInvokeInteractiveUI
  RasEapFreeMemory
  MsgWaitForMultipleObjectsExt
  PeekMessageWExt
  TranslateMessageExt
  DispatchMessageExt
  GetNetStringSizeExt
